{"server":"tw","storyId":"act40side_level_act40side_08_beg","groupId":"act40side","stageId":"act40side_08","title":"金玉藏心","storyCode":"OR-8","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act40side/level_act40side_08_beg.txt","sourceHash":"2129b668bcf0a2d0af695bd6079b51e9509e53db24c10b62a4297cc274414103","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g1_yusrestaurant"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要一份桔紅酥……打包帶走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喲，來啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次還是寄去維多利亞嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……不寄了。我馬上就要回去了……能不能回去，也不好說就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這次——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，咳咳咳！就打包一份點心，路上吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸欸，怎麼咳成了這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你還是別吃甜食了，我熬一碗枇杷水給你喝吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事……沒事……不是肺上的毛病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管哪裡的病都要注意啊，看過大夫了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看過，看過了。大夫說，我活不了多久啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想吃點什麼，也不用忌口了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，沒事……人總有一死嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要做的事，差不多也都做完了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎……怎麼可以有這種念頭！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是說……你在維多利亞還有家人，她……她們還在等你回家啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊……我也盼著，能再見她們一面，但想必是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳……不能如願了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我此生雖然一事無成，但自以為沒有愧對過心中那一點理想、道義。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可到頭才發現，對她們，我實在虧欠太多……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉……人不就是這樣，哪有碟子不磕著碗的？一個人要是打心眼裡覺得自己對得起所有人，那才叫沒心沒肺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算這樣，你也不能就不打算回家去了啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想見她們，但是不見，可以讓她們活得更好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人不就這樣……總得放下點什麼，才能成全點什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們都放下了，我也該放下了……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小大廚，這些年多受你照顧，連最後這點大夢囈語，也只能說給你聽了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你還有……什麼願望嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"顧筌","speakerId":"avg_npc_1616_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的願望……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g12_ningfucourtyard"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仔細點，都仔細點。看看你掃過的這地，全是灰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些邊邊角角的地方都別漏了，髒東西都打掃乾淨。要搬走了，也別給這屋子後來的主人留麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧府管家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"老爺，都這麼晚了，您上哪去啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒事，別管我，我就出去散散步。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧府雜役","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"寧大人今天真奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧府雜役","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這中秋節，不待在屋裡賞月，怎麼監督起我們打掃了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧府管家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別想了，專心掃你的地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧府管家","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今晚月亮把這裡照得這麼敞亮，地上的事也把它打掃乾淨一些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎麼……在這……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爺爺的書房？"},{"type":"narration","text":"腦袋又昏又沉，自己好像忘記了什麼重要的事。\n一本陳舊的書冊，靜靜躺在案頭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"《炎史一百廿四卷十七策補》……1062年……太史閣裡哪裡有這一卷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……爺爺？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g14_yanprison"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"監獄衛兵A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這第五層的監獄多久沒關過犯人了，今晚進來的這位，什麼來頭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"監獄衛兵B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"御前行刺，被禁軍親手逮回來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"監獄衛兵A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這麼狠——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"監獄衛兵B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"噓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"監獄衛兵B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別多想，別多問，看緊就是了。出了半點差錯，你我加起來都不夠頂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"從我回到百灶起，遇上的每件事都像是安排好的。\n擺在我面前的一系列線索像是誘餌，最終都指向一個死局。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_i05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"作案者不僅武功高強，還對大理寺相當熟悉，而且一定與虞澄早有串聯……"},{"type":"narration","text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"虞澄指名要讓你來做審決他時的筆錄，這是你現在站在這裡的原因，也是我不能讓你進一步參與的原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"諶徹","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不管虞澄有什麼謀劃，你一定是其中的一環。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g15_restaurantlobby"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴面具的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……麟少卿既然問出了這樣的問題，心裡難道沒有答案？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴面具的人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"麟少卿到底是看不到真相，還是因為不敢看，才假裝看不到？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g9_dalitemple"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"解真御史為何偏偏對虞澄的案件如此在意？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g14_yanprison"},{"type":"narration","text":"月漸西沉，月光越過鐵窗，灑在一方囚室，夜氣凝露，打在麟青硯的眉心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果不是一股霉味，這大獄裡倒是個靜思的好地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊。不過是在這待了一會，許多事情都想通了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卷牘庫的那把火，是你放的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是我出現在這裡給了麟少卿答案，還是你已經提前一步想通了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又見面了，麟少卿。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g1_yusrestaurant"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，我這會沒心情和你掰扯點心的事，我還得去救人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別急，別急，你忙活的事，著急就有用了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道什麼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我只知道，火候不到，蓋揭不開的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唉，天大的事不能耽誤吃飯，吃不下飯，什麼事都是白搭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先嚐嚐吧，這是不是你要找的桔紅酥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你……不是口口聲聲說，全百灶也找不到我要找的味道嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我還說了，我就是百灶最厲害的廚師，只要是這世上存在過的味道，我都能複製出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下，這是我自己做的，我們那個賭可不作數啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這不就是你之前做過的桔紅酥……"},{"type":"narration","text":"煌半信半疑，夾起了一塊點心放入嘴中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"narration","text":"這幾日她嚐過了不少美食，學到了不少衡量一道菜品優劣的辦法。擺在眼前的糕點，算不上好吃。\n行箸說得一點也沒錯，點心裡放太多糖，的確會蓋過桔皮的清香，過多的油也破壞了點心外面酥皮的口感。\n這不是一道好吃的點心……\n但這恰恰就是她記憶中的味道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼……會做這種味道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是一直說，我做的桔紅酥不夠甜，我就在想，到底是哪裡的廚師會這麼做桔紅酥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後來想到，有沒有可能，把這道糕點做得那麼甜的人，根本不是為了好吃呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做點心不是為了好吃是指……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說，你是在維多利亞吃到這道點心的，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是想起，好多年前，店裡常來的一個客人。他總是習慣點一份桔紅酥，說要寄給國外的女兒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說路上太遠，點心寄過去早就壞了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可他偏偏不信邪，自己做了加工，又用信紙在包裝上裹了一層又一層，也不知道到底是寄信還是寄點心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你認識他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他來過這裡……我一直在找他……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知不知道，他到底是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算不上認識吧。他就是這家店很多年前的一位常客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"依稀記得，他常常早上天不亮的時候就過來，點一份最便宜的早餐。然後就在窗邊坐著，像是在等什麼人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等什麼人……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大廚","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我哪知道，你自己看囉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g2_downtownarea"},{"type":"narration","text":"天濛濛亮。\n依稀可見的圓月尚掛在天邊，良宵將盡，或許很多人還沉睡在一個佳期團圓的夢裡。\n勤於生計的小販早早出攤，悠長的吆喝響徹長街，叫醒這座偌大的城市。\n煌看到，街角出現了一個熟悉的身影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_i06_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"平時誰也不會注意到，這家小飯館和那座幽深的宅邸只隔了一個街角。\n這樣的景象，他是不是已經看了好多年？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_i06_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真的是你……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g1_yusrestaurant"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧茵","speakerId":"avg_4172_xingzh_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你在這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g9_dalitemple"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒想到，活著的時候，還能見到你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"倚坐在牆角的人衣著破落，手捧一塊月餅，吃得滿鬚滿臉，全然不顧來訪的客人。\n穹頂上的鐵窗漏下天光一抹，照在囚犯清臞的臉上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大理寺也是厚道，這大獄裡候審的犯人，中秋節都還能分一塊月餅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還蠻好吃的，嚐一塊？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必了，眼看著將來要在這大牢裡吃一陣子飯了，不差這一口。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜了，我們要說的還多著呢，總不好乾聊吧？"},{"type":"narration","text":"老人喉嚨間擠出一聲乾笑，竟在穿囚服的人對面席地坐下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你惦記著要質問我這個老頭子，惦記了幾十年，今天終於如願以償了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寧大人應該恨透了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就差一步，你就可以安心回你的老家，讓你的子孫陪著你安享晚年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就差這一步……哈哈哈哈哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說，我確實該恨你，我都恨不得衝上去咬下你身上一口肉來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可轉念一想，你為了我這個老頭子，搭上了幾十年的時間、大理寺少卿的官職，還有眼看著只能在這獄裡度過的餘生——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼看都該是你更恨我才對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈……寧大人實在是多慮了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就說過了，我不是什麼好官，更不是什麼好人……和顧筌不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不過是一個老饕，就喜歡聞著味找那藏得最深的真相。剝殼食肉，食髓知味。哪怕把這雙手弄得鮮血淋漓，咬掉滿口老牙，我也樂意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幾十年裡，您就是我餐桌上那隻最大最肥的殼獸，我哪能恨您呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算要恨……也不是因為我自己的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的牙口到底是好，啃下來我這塊老骨頭，也沒見你咬掉牙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是虞澄啊虞澄，你怎麼就鐵了心覺得，我今天一定會來見你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是我就這麼一走了之，你這麼多年的苦心謀劃，豈不是都付諸東流了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈……因為我瞭解你。我太瞭解你了，寧大人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就是在賭，你在官場上沉浮數十載，你的手不乾淨，但你還是個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"畢竟你讓顧筌在你身邊活了那麼多年，也養了他的女兒那麼多年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在意那個孩子……那兩個孩子的死活。在你有生之年，你也想看到她們清清白白地在太陽底下活著……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你清楚，只要你一天不鬆口，她們就一日不得安寧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你一定會來見我……你必須來見我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些事你都查到了……看來該查的，你早已經查得差不多了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有多久了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有的線索，拼湊得七七八八，想通這案子裡的每一環，不過是去年的事吧。愧為大理寺少卿，手腳實在是慢了點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是顧筌，怕是好多年前就查得清清楚楚了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這我確實沒有想到……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當年他回到百灶，你把他控制在自己身邊。但沒有想到，他就在你府上抄了十幾年的信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就透過這一封封達官顯貴之間的信，他一個九品的奉禮郎，找到了當年那場血案中活下來的每一個人，抽絲剝繭，最終拼湊出了真相。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這個顧筌，用心深遠，我還真是小瞧了他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事到如今，寧大人還有什麼話想說？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈……還有什麼話要說？該認的罪，我當然會認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當年主理太師一案的刑部尚書，的確是我派人殺的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但不是因為他指控我是太師謀逆的黨羽……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是因為，太師謀逆，從頭到尾就是件冤案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g14_yanprison"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是有些好奇，麟少卿是何時猜到的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鼎豐樓起火時，我就懷疑過那個人是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為何？我應該和那些事沒有什麼關係吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是直覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算當時你沒有用你自己的武功，那蒙面人的身形和身手還是讓我隱約覺得十分熟悉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可後來在大理寺你主動找我，又讓我打消了這個疑慮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回過頭想想，早在我準備彈劾虞澄的時候，你應該就已經和他接觸頗深了。我沒有想到，你居然早就和虞澄有了合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從卷牘庫的火到寧府的掛畫，再到鼎豐樓的火，最近發生的這幾件疑案，都是你在引導我去找線索？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情急之下，手段是著急了點。現在再看，倒有幾分兒戲了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那百珍宴上的火……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很遺憾，那的確不是我所為，不過陰差陽錯，倒也幫忙達成了我們的目的就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們做了這麼多事，究竟是為了什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說來荒唐，這一切的開始，不過是一樁不大不小的陳年舊案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是我入職肅政院後，偶然接觸到的一樁案子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刑部尚書被路邊乞丐當街刺殺。這樣荒唐的案子，居然沒頭沒尾地草草結案了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算那兇手已經伏法，可他的身分、行刺的動機……卷宗裡有太多曖昧不明的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當我想要進一步追查下去時，卻發現所有的線索都指向了另一件更大的案子，且所有線索也都被那個案子截斷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太師謀逆案……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟少卿也是調查過的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"三公謀逆，驚天大案，受牽連者成千上萬。別說去查明真相，在那段時間，提及那位大人都是莫大的禁忌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“太師使皇子弒君。”史書上只留下了這樣一句話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是老真龍去世的那一晚，沒有人知道究竟發生了什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城防的軍隊到底由誰調動，走入那座宮殿的人又是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後來我才發現，我竟然不是唯一一個在追查這件案子的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是這個時候認識了虞澄？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該說是臭味相投，還是一見如故？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說你們查不到線索，又如何斷定太師是蒙冤的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不是我們查到的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"查明這一切的人，是顧筌。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g9_dalitemple"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你當真不明白為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當然明白，我就是想問問寧大人，這個“為什麼”，你親口說出來的時候，嘴裡是什麼滋味？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……民意滔滔，人心惶惶……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有經歷過的人才知道，炎國當下的太平圖景，來之不易。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那確實是很久以前的事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老真龍一生勤勉，那時，源石工業改變了這片大地的格局。而他讓炎國，在那個風雲動蕩的時代沒有落後於泰拉諸國。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是這樣一位雄主，晚年卻感染了礦石病。他認為自己時日無多，種種政舉，也失之偏頗……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時那位皇子有意阻止真龍……太師也站在了他那一邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所謂的太師支持，是太師授意儲君奪權篡位嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老真龍死在了皇子入宮勸諫的晚上，那位皇子也自此下落不明。這驚天動地的事，需要一個說法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……所以需要有一個人來背負這一切罪名。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你以為，當今真龍不知道嗎……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"朝局更替，人心自然動蕩。“肅清逆黨”，正是個適合的名號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時尚且年輕的真龍用雷霆手段，掃清了不少心懷不軌的人，用最短的時間穩定了局面，沒有讓這場宮廷之禍蔓延到禁城之外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"四十年了，我本以為，我是除真龍外，唯一一個還記得這段往事的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到那起案子過去十幾年後，那個年輕人，再次出現在了我的面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"寧大人恐怕說得太輕巧了些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當時被“掃清”的，不只幾個亂臣賊子，還有太師全家上下，二十八人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些人盡數入獄，他們有的為了自證清白，自盡於獄中；活下來的，也都被流放。我試著去尋找過他們的蹤跡，卻是一個都找不到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除了一個孩子……在動亂時被帶走的，當時還在襁褓裡的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒想過她還活著，也從沒相信她真的已經死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看來你已經見過她了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾天前見過了……長相看不出幾分相似了。但是那脾性，倒真像一個模子裡刻出來的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顧筌在百灶十幾年，到死都沒有吐露關於那個孩子下落的半個字……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想必寧大人現在也該明白了，顧筌為什麼會死在回維多利亞的路上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……虞澄，你這個老東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"寧述","speakerId":"avg_npc_1614_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要讓顧筌用自己的死，杜絕所有人找到那個孩子下落的可能，也給你一個調查我的機會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我那時以為，顧筌苦苦追查太師一案不得結果，心灰意冷，決定離開百灶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也是過了許多年才想明白，顧筌想要的不是一個所謂的真相，你剛剛說的那些糾葛，他早在那時候，其實心裡就已經有了答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"虞澄","speakerId":"avg_npc_1617_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他希望我做到的，是另一件事。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g14_yanprison"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道從一開始，你們就知道煌是那場案件的遺孤？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟少卿應該也已經調查到了，顧筌和虞澄，其實早就認識了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顧筌自從帶走那個孩子以後，將這個秘密牢牢藏了幾十年，但是臨終前，他將這個孩子的下落，告訴了他當時唯一的“朋友”，虞澄。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在顧筌死後，虞澄立即開始尋找那個孩子的下落。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是當時他作為大理寺少卿，不便親自行動，為了不引人注目，他便委託當時尚不在朝局中央的我暗中尋訪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當我在維多利亞找到她時，發現她已經是一名感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不能立刻將她帶回百灶，為了保護她，我只好先將她送去一家救治感染者的醫療機構。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"竟然是你……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來早在那時候，你們就已經串通好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在這個計劃裡，麟少卿也早就是其中的一部分了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這又是何意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟少卿如何能接觸到煌的線索，又如何能接觸到那些過去的卷宗，麟少卿應該不會覺得這些都是偶然吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青硯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1612_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虞澄不會親自告訴你這些。這件事太冒險，這世上不能有第三個人知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但他一直在尋找一個適合的人選……一個有勇氣，站在真相這一邊的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虞澄早就做好了捨身的準備，我可以弄髒這雙手，替他去做一些不得不為之事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，還不夠。我們還需要有一個清清白白的人，用能見得了光的手段，讓這個真相重見天日。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟少卿，時候差不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"現在還有最後一個機會……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟少卿，還願不願意讓這個真相重見天日？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
